[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083059234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108699#issuecomment-3083059234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108699","id":3083059234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63w8Ai","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T08:06:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T08:06:59Z","body":"Just to confirm, this fixes the infinite loop because the size was incorrect before? \r\n\r\nWith this change you still get the \"cannot call get_pixel()\" error though right?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083059234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083105203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108699#issuecomment-3083105203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108699","id":3083105203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63xHOz","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T08:19:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T08:40:37Z","body":"> Just to confirm, this fixes the infinite loop because the size was incorrect before?\r\n\r\nIt's not, size is the same, and it's not an infinite loop.\r\n\r\n`get_pixel` is not supported by compressed textures, so it's spamming errors for every pixel in the texture (x2, since it's two nested loops), and logging errors is not particularly fast (and getting slower as the number of messages increase). It will probably finish in a few minutes (if the texture is small enough and the editor won't run out of memory or message queue space before, which is likely what will happen).\r\n\r\n*Edit:*\r\n> *if the texture is small enough and the editor won't run out of memory or message queue space before, which is likely what will happen*\r\n\r\n*tested it with MRP from the issue, as predicted, crashes with `Failed method: EditorToaster::_error_handler_impl. Message queue out of memory. Message queue out of memory. Try increasing 'memory/limits/message_queue/max_size_mb' in project settings.` after 6 min (about half way).*\r\n\r\nWith decompressed texture, `get_pixel` should always work.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083105203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083215783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108699#issuecomment-3083215783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108699","id":3083215783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63xiOn","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T08:51:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T08:51:58Z","body":"Makes sense. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083215783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"